OL,5,G2000 Location, Location, Location
OL,6,     FIn Warwickshire, can Isla and Luke
OL,7,     Foverlook a cemetery to call a new
OL,8,     Fhouse home? And Jan and Jon
OL,9,     Fexplore a property plethora of
OL,10,     Fsnugs, party-ready gardens and
OL,11,     Fgames room galore.
OL,12,G2100 Grand Designs
OL,13,     FJana and Rory's conversion of an
OL,14,     Fold driving test centre into sleek
OL,15,     Fupside-down living has stalled
OL,16,     Fover the years. With drive and
OL,17,     Fdetermination, can they finally
OL,18,     Ftake the project up a gear?
